translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_4ec3f431:

    # "Both of you are sitting in the elder's tent, the lantern on Hezzong's hand glows faintly."
    "你们两人正坐在长老的帐篷里，赫宗手中的提灯散发着微光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_8c058a9f:

    # hz "On the paper, it says you volunteered to be the watcher tonight."
    hz "纸上写着，你自愿报名当今晚的守夜人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_4588662f:

    # "Hezzong, the elder chief of the tribe, checks the paper on his hand before looking back at you."
    "部落的大长老赫宗查看着手中的文件，然后抬眼看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_6501c59e:

    # "This was meant to be a routine job, but you certainly have a different plan in mind."
    "这本来只是份例行工作，但你显然另有打算。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_96a41ce8:

    # yu "Yes, I did."
    yu "是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_23520140:

    # "You nod, your eyes are fixed on the elder. A pleading gaze is all you can muster."
    "你点了点头，目光紧紧盯着长老。你能做出的，也只有这副恳求的眼神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_208032a5:

    # "The red dragon is sitting across the table, his brows are furrowed."
    "那条红龙正坐在桌子对面，眉头紧锁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_1aee9e66:

    # "Everyone in the tribe calls him the Allfather, he has been the elder chief for as long as you can remember."
    "部落里的每个人都称他为天父。从你记事起，他一直都是部落的大长老。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_d6e32247:

    # "He is the one who taught you how to read and write, took you into his house as you help him manage the books."
    "是他教会了你读书写字，还让你住进他的家中，帮他管理账簿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_caefdb77:

    # hz "I don't think you're ready for this, espcially after what happened to Chime."
    hz "我认为你还没准备好，尤其是在齐门出事之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_575a76b2:

    # yu "I- I am ready, Hezz."
    yu "我、我准备好了，赫宗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_66a31b66:

    # "You stutter, your voice is shaking. This is a crucial decision to make but you are determined in your path."
    "你说话结结巴巴，声音也在发抖。这是个至关重要的决定，但你已经下定决心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_52cfc2ba:

    # hz "You understand the duty of being the tribe's watcher, right?"
    hz "你明白身为部落守夜人的职责，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_a138c5cb:

    # yu "I understand."
    yu "我明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_2d915fc9:

    # hz "Mhmm... just to make sure, I will tell you again."
    hz "嗯……以防万一，我再告诉你一遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_32613232:

    # hz "As a watcher, you have to keep the tribe safe at night, and keep those sprites from ever entering our place."
    hz "作为守夜人，你必须在夜间保护部落的安全，还要阻止那些幽魂进入我们的地盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_ed59b27a:

    # yu "I know."
    yu "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_c7128ba4:

    # "The elder reads through the paper again, before he takes another glance at you and notices your mind wandering off."
    "长老又把文件从头到尾看了一遍，随后再次瞥向你，发现你的心思早已飘远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_8cec094c:

    # "He sighs, and puts the paper down."
    "他叹了口气，把文件放到一旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_0d5be0f2:

    # hz "How is the search for Chime going? I heard you guys have been looking for him for a week now."
    hz "齐门找得怎么样了？我听说你们已经找了他一周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_458a0813:

    # yu "I- I haven't found him yet."
    yu "我、我还没找到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_8f8f8137:

    # "You look down at your feet, your hands are shaking."
    "你低头看向自己的双脚，双手不停颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_6f800c99:

    # "Chime has been your best friend ever since you were young, and losing him was the last thing you want to happen."
    "齐门从小就是你最要好的朋友，你最不愿看到的就是失去他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_70ad9730:

    # hz "That is worrying, I didn't think he would be missing for this long."
    hz "这太令人担心了，我没想到他会失踪这么久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_de0dcc64:

    # hz "People don't just disppear like that. Especially not him, he is a good kid."
    hz "人不会就这样凭空消失，更何况是他——他可是个好孩子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_9b32b899:

    # yu "The thing is, I saw a flickering light around our post last week, I think it was him."
    yu "问题是，上周我在哨站附近看见了一道闪烁的光，我觉得那就是他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_35356058:

    # hz "I see... are you sure you're not hallucinating... or dreaming? It's been a long time since you slept."
    hz "我明白……你确定自己不是出现幻觉了……或者当时在做梦？你已经很久没睡了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_158a4beb:

    # hz "At least that's what the folks back there told me, they are all tired after following your lead for a week."
    hz "至少后面那些人是这么告诉我的，他们跟着你的带领找了一周，也都累了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_e0eb6ce6:

    # yu "I know, I understand if they withdraw from the search, but I won't quit until I find him."
    yu "我知道，他们想退出搜索我也能理解，但在找到他之前，我不会放弃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_5a7a049f:

    # hz "At some point, maybe the best way ahead is to stop walking forward and think for a moment."
    hz "有时候，继续前进的最好办法，或许就是先停下来，花点时间想一想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_467e2e2b:

    # yu "I just want to find him and bring him back safe, allfather. Please, let me be the watcher for today."
    yu "我只想找到他，把他平安带回来，天父。求你了，让我今天来守夜吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_5be17a99:

    # "He shakes his head, and sighs."
    "他摇了摇头，叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_8fef3874:

    # hz "You have to go in alone, if you were to be the watcher today, I'm not sure anyone is available after all the turmoils they've been put through."
    hz "如果今天由你来守夜，就只能一个人进去。我不确定还有谁能来帮忙，毕竟他们已经经历了那么多动荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_754de6e7:

    # yu "I am aware of that, allfather."
    yu "我知道，天父。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_02bcfcee:

    # hz "Is this really what you think?"
    hz "你真的这么想吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_9c08697e:

    # hz "What if you go missing next? Where do I find someone who can manage my books?"
    hz "要是下一个失踪的是你呢？那我上哪儿去找人来帮我理账？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_2bf9e618:

    # hz "And someone foolish enough to stay up late with me?"
    hz "还有谁会傻到陪我熬夜呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_f1a8b8bb:

    # "You don't know what to say, you look at the elder's eyes, and despite his chuckle, you can see the worry in his eyes."
    "你不知道该说什么，只能望着大长老的双眼。尽管他轻声笑着，你还是能看见其中的忧虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_7da61a4c:

    # "It's been a long time since he appointed you as his assistant. Apart from spending time with Chime, helping the elder was your second most treasured time to spend."
    "他任命你做助手已经有很长一段时间了。除了和齐门共度的时光，帮助大长老也是你最珍惜的第二段时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_33ce0b16:

    # yu "I- I don't know, allfather. I just want to find Chime."
    yu "我——我不知道，天父。我只想找到齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_20ac27b1:

    # "The elder shakes his head."
    "大长老摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_72460c52:

    # hz "Perhaps, a glimpse of hope is what my little red dragon needs. Maybe you'll prove me wrong and bring him back alive."
    hz "或许，我的小红龙需要的正是一线希望。也许你会证明我是错的，把他活着带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_42c970f2:

    # "Hezzong feints a weak smile, he lowers the lantern and slowly shoves it across the table."
    "赫宗勉强挤出一个微笑，放低提灯，慢慢将它推过桌面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_9d694ff4:

    # hz "I am going to trust you on this. But you have to promise me you will be extra careful."
    hz "这次我愿意相信你。但你得答应我，一定要格外小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_86a6b402:

    # hz "Take this with you, I should be able to track you down if you get lost in the night."
    hz "把这个带上。要是你在夜里迷路了，我应该就能找到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_bf7978dd:

    # yu "Thank you, Hezz."
    yu "谢谢你，赫宗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_90eb4087:

    # "You take the lantern and put it on your side, the warmth of the lantern is strangely hot even on your hand."
    "你拿起提灯放在身旁，灯的暖意落在手上竟显得异常灼热。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_3abd377e:

    # hz "When it's dawn, just come back safe, you don't need to stay until the morning."
    hz "天一亮就平安回来，不必一直待到早上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_a0843e3c:

    # yu "Okay, allfather."
    yu "好的，大长老。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_df857b04:

    # hz "That's good. Okay, then let us head out, I will show you the way."
    hz "那就好。好了，我们出发吧，我来带路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_3daf9da8:

    # "The allfather pushes open the door, and you follow him out."
    "大长老推开门，你跟着他走了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_72c947bd:

    # "The night is quiet, the moon is shining bright, and the stars are twinkling in the sky."
    "夜色寂静，月光明亮，繁星在天际闪烁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_0a2fbfc7:

    # "Everyone else is sleeping, the lifeless silence has you shiver down to the core, but Hezzong's mere presence made you feel a lot safer."
    "其他人都已入睡，死寂令你从骨子里发冷，但赫宗仅仅在身边，就让你安心了许多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_6dc98dde:

    # "Hezzong whistles softly as you follow close behind, the torch in his hand is lighting up the path just enough."
    "你紧跟在赫宗身后，他轻轻吹着口哨，手中的火炬只能勉强照亮前路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_90dc49f3:

    # "You hold your own latern tightly, your heart is beating faster than your feet, your fear of being stranded haunts you again."
    "你紧紧攥着自己的提灯，心跳比脚步还快，被孤身一人的恐惧再次缠上心头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Beginning_Talk_55f8ada7:

    # "Catching up with Hezzong, you follow him into the forest."
    "追上赫宗后，你跟着他走进森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_435c0476:

    # yu "Hezz, how's the tribe going lately?"
    yu "长老，最近部落还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_f876c6af:

    # hz "Well, we're doing fine. The harvest is good this year, and we have enough food to last us through the winter."
    hz "嗯，我们过得还不错。今年收成很好，食物足够撑过冬天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_1143a178:

    # hz "But, we're still missing Chime, and that's a big problem."
    hz "但齐门至今下落不明，这可是个大问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_40f93814:

    # hz "Afterall, he is not one who wanders off without telling anyone."
    hz "毕竟，他不是那种不告诉任何人就自己跑掉的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_849afa84:

    # hz "Shudo and Pairon were worried pant-less, especially after you told them you had to get in the forest by yourself."
    hz "舒笃和帕里恩都担心得要命，尤其是在你告诉他们必须独自进入森林之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_00f15793:

    # yu "I'm sorry Hezz, I didn't mean to worry them. But they know I will keep searching while they rest."
    yu "对不起，长老，我不是故意要让他们担心的。但他们知道，他们休息时我也会继续寻找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_dffae502:

    # hz "Hmm, don't worry about it, I will tell them you're safe when you come back."
    hz "嗯，别放在心上。等你回来，我会告诉他们你平安无事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_1a1af4f3:

    # hz "Look, we are not a big tribe, we need to look for each other's back, especially in times like this."
    hz "你看，我们不是个大部落，必须彼此照应，尤其是这种时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_6df21e82:

    # yu "I know, I know. I just want to find Chime and bring him back."
    yu "我知道，我知道。我只是想找到齐门，把他带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_bc7e7f02:

    # hz "You know, I'm worried about you too. You haven't slept for a week, and you look like a mess."
    hz "你知道，我也很担心你。你已经一周没睡了，看起来也狼狈不堪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_0d58f772:

    # "You look down at your feet, maybe he's right, but what is the alternative... do you just give up on the search."
    "你低头看着自己的脚。长老或许是对的，但你还有什么选择……难道就这样放弃寻找吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3feb7cac:

    # "You don't ever want to think about living in a world without your best friend, even at the cost of wearing out your body bit by bit."
    "你不愿去想象没有至交好友的生活，哪怕代价是让自己的身体一点点被拖垮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_2748387b:

    # yu "Would he be okay? I mean, if I don't find him now, what's the chance of him... ever coming back."
    yu "他会没事吗？我是说，如果我现在不找到他，他……还有可能回来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_c7424302:

    # hz "I- uh... Well."
    hz "我——呃……嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_06aee3a8:

    # hz "I will be honest with you, the chance is only getting lower and lower as time passes."
    hz "我实话告诉你，时间越久，这个可能性就越渺茫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_0ba95c65:

    # hz "But we aren't giving up on him, our search party hasn't stopped yet, and we will keep looking for him."
    hz "但我们不会放弃寻找他，我们的搜寻队还没有停止行动，也会继续找下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_591f9294:

    # yu "Okay."
    yu "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3aaf063d:

    # yu "Hezz, do you know why... Chime's missing?"
    yu "长老，你知道……齐门为什么不见了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_56f3617b:

    # hz "There is no way I can know, but I have a feeling that it's not a good sign."
    hz "我不可能知道，但我有种预感，这不是什么好兆头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_4a280ab3:

    # yu "Why are you saying that?"
    yu "你为什么这么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_c014d137:

    # hz "I only just recalled now, but the day before he went missing, he told me about a pair of eyes while we were hunting."
    hz "我刚刚才想起来，他失踪的前一天，我们一起打猎时，他提到过一双眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_bb469eb3:

    # hz "He said there were horns behind the eyes, and it was staring at him from the bushes."
    hz "他说那双眼睛后面长着角，而且那个东西正从灌木丛里盯着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_79d0db84:

    # hz "I didn't think much of it at the time, so I told him, well. Maybe it's your friend messing with you."
    hz "当时我没太在意，所以就跟他说，呃，可能是你的朋友在捉弄你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_0a14b3ae:

    # hz "But now that I think of it, it's a little worrying."
    hz "但现在回想起来，确实有点让人担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_28acdb1d:

    # yu "Hezz, couldn't you have told me this earlier?"
    yu "长老，这事你就不能早点告诉我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3c97bf31:

    # hz "I didn't think it was important... I thought it was you or someone else, after all, horns aren't something rare in our tribe."
    hz "我没觉得那很重要……我还以为那是你，或者别的什么人，毕竟我们部落里长角并不稀奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_8182700b:

    # yu "W-what if he's kidnapped by that pair of eyes?"
    yu "难道他是被那双眼睛绑架了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_67f51c85:

    # hz "Or, it can still be something else innocent, and uhm... he just got lost in the forest."
    hz "或许那也可能只是别的无害之物，呃……他只是迷路在森林里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_dad363b4:

    # yu "After you told me this, I'm not sure if I can believe he {i}just{/i} got lost."
    yu "得知你说的这些后，我不太相信他只是{i}单纯{/i}迷路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_e5689667:

    # hz "Maybe you are right."
    hz "也许你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_0e5be6e7:

    # hz "Didn't you mention having seen a glowing light somewhere?"
    hz "你之前不是说在什么地方看到过发光的东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_1c496b36:

    # yu "I thought it was Chime, but I'm not sure now."
    yu "我原以为那是齐门，但现在也不确定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3fa769d8:

    # hz "Well, maybe it's someone else's."
    hz "嗯，也许那是别人的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_6cb3fe54:

    # hz "If he's kidnapped, then we have to track that person down, somehow. But we have no trails to start off of."
    hz "如果他是被绑架了，那我们无论如何都得想办法找到那个人。但我们没有任何线索可供追查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3ac77472:

    # yu "You're right."
    yu "你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_f27be97b:

    # yu "Hezz, what do I need to do as a watcher?"
    yu "长老，作为守夜人，我需要做些什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_2616a8b3:

    # hz "Well, as a normal watcher, you just need to keep the tribe safe at night, and alert us if anything suspicious happen."
    hz "嗯，普通守夜人只需要在夜里保护部落安全，发现任何可疑情况就向我们示警。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_48711521:

    # hz "Usually, we assign two watchers every night to perform this job, but they don't seem to be available tonight."
    hz "通常我们每晚会安排两名守夜人负责这项工作，但他们今晚似乎都无法值守。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_ff260648:

    # hz "It's a routine job, but it's important. You know, we don't want those sprites to come in and steal our food."
    hz "这是项例行工作，但很重要。你知道，我们可不想让那些精灵进来偷走我们的食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_bff81938:

    # yu "What should I do if I see one?"
    yu "当然是战斗。你有剑，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_3de55463:

    # hz "Fight, of course. You have a sword, right?"
    hz "当然是战斗。你有剑，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_ec9559e5:

    # yu "Yes, I do. But it's not very sharp."
    yu "有是有，但这把剑不太锋利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_9455fb67:

    # hz "It's fine, it's not like you're going to fight a demon or something."
    hz "没关系，又不是要你去跟恶魔之类的东西战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_056070d0:

    # yu "Well I hope not."
    yu "嗯，希望不是吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_6294513b:

    # hz "If you lost your sword, just raise your arm, puff out your chest and make a loud noise. These sprites are not very brave, they will scramble at the slightest bit of sound."
    hz "如果你把剑弄丢了，就抬起手臂、挺起胸膛，大声喊叫。这些幽魂胆子不大，稍微有点声响就会四散逃跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_8f256263:

    # "Hezzong demonstrates as he pulls his shoulders back, showing off his huge chest muscles in confidence."
    "赫宗自信地向后张开双肩，展示着他硕大的胸肌，给你做示范。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_2d9914e4:

    # hz "See, that's pretty easy."
    hz "看，这很简单吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_53f672c4:

    # "He smirks at your blushed gaze, obviously proud of his act having an opposite effect on you."
    "他看着你红着脸、目不转睛的目光，得意地勾起嘴角，显然很得意自己的举动反而对你起了反效果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_ab555e41:

    # yu "Well..."
    yu "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_e74dbc3c:

    # yu "Who are those sprites, actually?"
    yu "那些幽魂究竟是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_e7bfe6a1:

    # "The elder shrugs, returning to his normal position, but his chest is still puffed out."
    "大长老耸了耸肩，恢复正常姿势，但胸膛依旧挺得高高的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_5759bab5:

    # hz "Wandering pests, nothing more. They are not dangerous, but they can be annoying."
    hz "不过是四处游荡的害虫，没别的了。它们没有危险，但会很烦人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_a7cf4b21:

    # yu "I see."
    yu "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_ab851ef2:

    # yu "You know, I haven't seen one before, so it's all new to me."
    yu "你知道，我以前从没见过幽魂，所以这一切对我来说都很新鲜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_d95b16c5:

    # hz "That's because the watchers are doing their job. Wouldn't you prefer that?"
    hz "那是因为守夜人尽职尽责。你不是更希望如此吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_738a31d1:

    # yu "You are right, allfather."
    yu "您说得对，至父。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_ddd1348d:

    # yu "Hezz, maybe I need to take a breather tomorrow."
    yu "赫宗，明天我可能得歇一歇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_98d82c67:

    # hz "What? Why?"
    hz "什么？为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_162406f0:

    # yu "I- I am still looking for Chime, just need some extra time to sleep."
    yu "我、我还在找齐门，只是需要多睡一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_80ba5239:

    # hz "You know, I can't do all the work by myself, right?"
    hz "你知道，我不可能一个人做完所有工作，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_f5c54ff4:

    # yu "Yeah, but you did, last time I checked you finished all the books and accounts by yourself while I was away."
    yu "可你确实做到了啊。上次我离开时，你一个人就把所有书册和账目都处理完了，我没记错吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_0f4867aa:

    # hz "But I can't finish all of these all the time, that's why I hired you."
    hz "但我不可能一直把这些事全都做完，所以才雇了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_554c38e4:

    # yu "But you did! You are perfectly capable to do so."
    yu "可你做到了！你完全有能力这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_e5ae3808:

    # hz "Yeah, you're right."
    hz "嗯，你说得对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_c6533285:

    # hz "Hey, how about this, I'll be honest with you. I care more about you than the ever-stacking books, I just want to keep you around while you're looking for Chime."
    hz "嘿，这样吧，我跟你说实话。我更在乎你，而不是那堆越摞越高的书。我只是想在你寻找齐门的时候把你留在身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_b4404d94:

    # hz "Perhaps, you can use my bed if you happen to be tired after the post. It's the closest from the tower, and I can keep an eye on you."
    hz "或许你守完夜累了，可以睡我的床。我的床离瞭望塔最近，而且我也能照看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_83da2bb5:

    # hz "And, I will make sure you get those extra sleep tomorrow. No need to worry about the books."
    hz "我会确保你明天能好好补觉。不用担心那些书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_eb4d3c79:

    # yu "Really? Thank you, Hezzong."
    yu "真的吗？谢谢你，赫宗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_c0483b72:

    # hz "I hope you don't mind sharing a bed with an old white-bearded dragon, or having to make it through my snores."
    hz "希望你不介意和一条白胡子老龙同床，也不介意熬过我的呼噜声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_82c2724d:

    # hz "I will try to keep it down, but I can't promise anything."
    hz "我会尽量小声点，但可没法保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_a11ed5ff:

    # yu "You're my allfather afterall, of course I don't mind. I'm already grateful to have a warm bed."
    yu "你可是我的天父，我当然不介意。有一张暖和的床睡，我已经很感激了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_4973b1f6:

    # hz "Good, then it's settled."
    hz "好，那就这么定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_126c5452:

    # yu "Hezzong, what should I do right now?"
    yu "赫宗，我现在该做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_72969426:

    # hz "Just try to take a look at the crate over there."
    hz "你先去看看那边的木箱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_fa3d48b6:

    # msg "Hint: Try to use Space, or the Interact button on the screen to interact with objects."
    msg "提示：尝试按空格键，或使用屏幕上的交互按钮与物体互动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_126c5452_1:

    # yu "Hezzong, what should I do right now?"
    yu "赫宗，我现在该做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_18c67447:

    # hz "You should pick up the turnips over there, and bring them into the crate."
    hz "你该把那边的大头菜捡起来，放进木箱里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_a08eae45:

    # msg "Hint: Try to use {i}E{/i}, or the hand button on the screen to pick up or drop objects."
    msg "提示：尝试按下{i}E{/i}键，或点击屏幕上的手形按钮，来拾起或放下物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_05146825:

    # yu "That's it for now, Hezz."
    yu "暂时就到这里，赫兹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_30664214:

    # hz "Alright, then let's keep up with the training."
    hz "好，那我们继续训练吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_371d5f7a:

    # "You enter the watchtower and climb upstairs, passing by the bell that Hezzong mentioned about."
    "你进入瞭望塔后登上楼梯，经过了赫宗提到的那口钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_38055bf5:

    # "On the top, you can see the entire tribe, and the forest surrounding it."
    "登上塔顶，整个部落和四周的森林尽收眼底。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_31d47b24:

    # yu "I guess this way I'll know it when the light comes back again."
    yu "我想，这样一来，那道光再次出现时我就能察觉到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_6db723d3:

    # "You have been waiting for a while, but nothing seems to be happening."
    "你已经等了一会儿，但似乎什么也没发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_aeefaad6:

    # "It's a little boring, but you have to keep your eyes open somehow..."
    "有点无聊，但总得想办法睁大眼睛保持警惕……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_3f780865:

    # "You look around, and see the lantern Hezzong gave you."
    "你环顾四周，看到了赫宗送给你的提灯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_24d22c59:

    # yu "Ring the bell... when something happens... right? Allfather said so."
    yu "如果发生什么事……就摇响警钟……对吧？大长老是这么说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_a7a36faa:

    # yu "No, allfather is always right, don't you dare to doubt him."
    yu "不，大长老总是对的，你可别怀疑他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_7bd22cd1:

    # "Bored as you are, you start to play with the lantern, and the bell."
    "你这么无聊，便开始摆弄起提灯和铃铛来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_41c6f2bc:

    # yu "Maybe I should go down and take a closer look, if there is light wouldn't the trees have covered it...? I won't be able to see from here."
    yu "也许我该下去仔细看看，要是有光，难道不会被树木挡住吗……？在这里我什么也看不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_b4b85a43:

    # yu "But allfather said I should stay here, and I should stay here."
    yu "但大长老说我应该待在这里，我就应该待在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_dd85d98d:

    # "Under the moonlight, you can see the forest, and the trees are swaying in the wind."
    "月光下，你能看见森林，树木在风中摇曳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Get_Onto_Watchtower_1ea660fd:

    # "You can hear the sound of the leaves rustling, and the wind is blowing through the trees."
    "你能听见树叶沙沙作响，风吹过树梢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_5d15684f:

    # "You can't help but think about Chime, and how he's doing right now."
    "你忍不住想起齐门，也不知道他现在怎么样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_4a59f4f2:

    # "Everything just reminds you of him, the games you used to play together, the stories he used to tell you, and the way he used to smile."
    "一切都让你想起他：你们曾一起玩的游戏、他曾给你讲的故事，还有他曾经的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_102d5eee:

    # "You miss him, and you want to find him, but you don't know where to start. You are afraid that you might never see him again."
    "你想念他，也想找到他，可你不知道该从哪里开始。你害怕自己可能再也见不到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_3c1359dc:

    # "That thought is unbearable, maybe it's the exact reason why you have not slept for days."
    "那个念头让你难以承受，也许这正是你已经好几天没睡觉的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_3a565242:

    # "You nudge at the skull necklace that he gave you, and it gives you a little bit of comfort to make it through the night."
    "你轻轻拨弄着他送给你的骷髅项链，它带给你一丝慰藉，让你熬过这个夜晚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_95ce2484:

    # "Maybe you should have accepted Hezzong's offer to sleep in his bed."
    "或许你本该接受赫宗的邀请，去他的床上睡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_c273027f:

    # "How would it feel to be in his bed, and to be held by your own elder?"
    "躺在他的床上，被自己的长辈抱着，会是什么感觉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_25522281:

    # "He has always been fond of you, and lately, he has been more caring than usual."
    "他一直很喜欢你，而最近更是比平时还要体贴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_e52e0569:

    # "Wouldn't you be a jerk to reject that old man? The way he's been worked up about you, and Chime, it's never seen on other people."
    "拒绝那个老人，难道不会显得你很混蛋吗？他为你和齐门操碎了心，这种程度在别人身上可从没见过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_916c7962:

    # "Plus, who would not want a huge, warm dragon pillow to hug through the night..."
    "再说了，谁不想抱着一个巨大而温暖的龙形抱枕睡过一整晚呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_ddae7f28:

    # "You should probably sleep, you are tired after all."
    "你大概该睡了，毕竟你很累。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_ab2a3688:

    # "It's perfect for a full night's sleep, but you have to find Chime, and you can't sleep until you find him."
    "一觉睡到天亮再合适不过了，可你必须找到齐门，在找到他之前你不能睡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_e24a6281:

    # "But... you are so tired, and you can't keep your eyes open, they are too dry."
    "可是……你实在太累了，眼睛干涩得睁不开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_c3e731bf:

    # "You decide to take a nap, and you lay down on the cold floor on top of the tower."
    "你决定小睡一会儿，躺在塔顶冰冷的地面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_a0b28009:

    # yu "Just a little nap, I won't sleep for long."
    yu "我就眯一小会儿，不会睡太久的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_88d52214:

    # "As soon as you finish your sentence, you have already fallen asleep."
    "话音刚落，你就已经睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_43a3e05c:

    # yu "Ahhh!"
    yu "啊啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_8f1096db:

    # "You decide to make it through, and you keep your eyes open."
    "你决定撑下去，继续睁着眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_94f287a8:

    # "There is no way you are sleeping, you have to fi-"
    "你绝不能睡着，你得找——"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_3690c817:

    # "You fell asleep, right on the table."
    "你就在桌子上睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_43a3e05c_1:

    # yu "Ahhh!"
    yu "啊啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_a764f35f:

    # "Shaking away your thoughts, you look around, trying to spot anything suspicious."
    "你甩去杂念，环顾四周，试图找出任何可疑之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_c8b4dc59:

    # "Suddenly a light flickers in the distance, and you can see it from the tower."
    "突然，远处有一道光闪烁起来，你在塔上也看得见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_1a077296:

    # "It's not far from the tower, maybe if you run down right now, you can catch it."
    "离塔并不远，也许你现在跑下去还能追上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_bc7f5c34:

    # "But you have to ring the bell, and you have to stay here. Just like what Hezzong said."
    "但你必须敲响警钟，留在这里。赫宗就是这么说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_5e5cf3f7:

    # "You sprint down the tower, carrying Hezzong's lantern with you and run towards the flickering light, leaving the bell behind."
    "你带着赫宗的提灯冲下塔楼，朝闪烁的光跑去，把警钟留在了身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_b84ce96a:

    # yu "Sorry Hezzong, it might be Chime..."
    yu "对不起，赫宗，可能是齐门……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_2350fc40:

    # "You run through the forest, and you can see the light getting closer and closer."
    "你穿过森林奔跑，眼看那道光越来越近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_70fdbfef:

    # "It's not long before you find the source of the light, and you can see a figure standing in front of you."
    "没过多久，你找到了光的源头，一个人影正站在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_f2f76917:

    # yu "Chime...? Is that you?"
    yu "齐门……？是你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_be943e1d:

    # "You can see the shadow of a horn slowly turns into a pair of antlers..."
    "你看见那只角的影子慢慢变成一对鹿角……"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_51a7fc69:

    # "You run down the tower, and ring the bell as loud as you can."
    "你冲下塔楼，竭尽全力敲响警钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_3d3169e1:

    # "Suddenly, something is lit up in the tribe, it seems your strategy is working."
    "突然，部落里有灯亮了起来，看来你的策略奏效了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_b3057f33:

    # "M-maybe they can catch Chime now, or the culprit."
    "说不定他们现在能抓到齐门，或者那个罪魁祸首。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_ce29e3e3:

    # "You go back a step to take a look through the windows, but, there's something missing."
    "你退后一步，透过窗户看去，可有样东西不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_295ef644:

    # "The light is gone, you can't see it anymore."
    "光不见了，你再也看不到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_61f36d3c:

    # "You scratch your head, and you can't help but feel a little bit of regret."
    "你挠了挠头，不禁有些后悔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_5e69f5c0:

    # yu "M-maybe I should have chased it, what if it was Chime."
    yu "我、我也许该追上去的，万一那是齐门呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_88d32ee6:

    # "You go downstairs to check if there's any remaining light, and suddenly, something is awry."
    "你下楼去查看是否还有残留的光，突然，情况有些不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_84136f0f:

    # "You can hear the sound of dirts and leaves being kicked up, and you can feel something pushing against you."
    "你听见尘土和树叶被踢起的声音，还感觉到有什么东西在推搡你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Puro_Watchtower_Thoughts_2d966d51:

    # yu "Huh?"
    yu "啊！？"

translate schinese_rewrite Encountering_Moine_cdc9131a:

    # "The sleep was short, as you are suddenly awaked by a strange sound."
    "这次睡得没多久，你突然被一阵奇怪的声音惊醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Encountering_Moine_2d966d51:

    # yu "Huh?"
    yu "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Encountering_Moine_67f38bb4:

    # "You think to yourself, as the sound of dirts and leaves being kicked up wakes you from the short slumber."
